cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or implement the em.json format, please cite this specification."
type: standard
title: "em.json — the Extended Matrix document format"
abstract: >-
  Specification of em.json, the document format of the Extended Matrix: a
  container of graphs (stratigraphic units, their relations in time, the
  paradata of reconstructions, 3D resources, layout), with its JSON Schemas and
  a conformance suite.
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
